.SH AI / OLLAMA
.TP
.B lo [ASK]
Ollama chat.
.TP
.B lo search [ASK]
Chat with web search.
.TP
.B lo @HOST [ASK]
Use another Ollama host for one session.
.TP
.B lo --conservative
Read/search only.
.TP
.B lo --workspace
Bounded workspace tools.
.TP
.B lo --power
Workspace tools plus shell commands; confirm every command.
.TP
.B lo --unsafe
Unrestricted shell after one explicit session-entry confirmation.
.TP
.B lk ollama
Show Ollama/selected-host status.
.TP
.B lk ollama models
Interactive model panel.
.TP
.B lk ollama test [--all]
Benchmark current or enabled installed models.
.TP
.B lk ollama host
List saved/reachable hosts.
.TP
.B lk ollama host NAME
Select persistent host.
.TP
.B lk ollama host local
Return to localhost.
.TP
.B lk ollama host NAME URL
Save and select a host.
.TP
.B lk ollama host forget NAME
Forget a host.
.TP
.B lk ollama share
Share local Ollama privately through Tailscale Serve.
.TP
.B lk ollama share status
Show share/proxy status.
.TP
.B lk ollama share off
Stop the share.
.TP
.B lk ollama key
Securely save the Ollama web-search key.
.TP
.B lk ollama key status
Report key configuration without revealing it.
.TP
.B lk ollama access [MODE]
Show/set conservative, workspace, power, or unsafe as the persistent profile.
.SH SETTINGS
.TP
.B lk settings
Unified interactive panel for access profile, Ollama host, preferred model, web-search key, and Ollama tailnet share.
It uses the same underlying state and commands; it is not a second configuration system.
